  "_doc": "v3 model registry. Adding a model = one line in `models` (provider must exist in `providers`). Prices are USD per 1M tokens; OpenRouter calls use the billed usage.cost when returned. `family` drives grader assignment (never grade a target with a same-family grader). `rpm`/`otpm` are client-side throttles; 429s and provider rate-limit headers are honoured on top. `trace` = what the provider returns as reasoning: raw (full chain of thought), summary (provider-written summary of hidden reasoning) or none; it only labels trace-analysis results and never changes a code path.",
